{"ref":"BDB, מִרְעֶה²","hw":"מִרְעֶה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְעֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14</a></sup> <strong>pasturage, pasture</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:4\" href=\"/Genesis.47.4\">Gn 47:4</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְעֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.14\">Is 32:14</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְעֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:8\" href=\"/Job.39.8\">Jb 39:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְעֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.18\">Ez 34:18</a>;—<em>pasturage</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַצֹּאן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:4\" href=\"/Genesis.47.4\">Gn 47:4</a> (J), cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.39\">1 Ch 4:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.41\">41</a>, also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.14\">Is 32:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שָׁמֵן וָטוֹב</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.40\">40</a>, cf. (fig.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.18\">18a</a>; of cattle <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:18\" href=\"/Joel.1.18\">Jo 1:18</a>, stag <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.6\">La 1:6</a>; = <em>pasture</em>, of wild ass <a data-ref=\"Job 39:8\" href=\"/Job.39.8\">Jb 39:8</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִירִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:12\" href=\"/Nahum.2.12\">Na 2:12</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעָרָה</span> <em>cave</em>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">מרעה</span>, We Now, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶעוֹן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶתֶר מִרְעֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.18\">Ez 34:18b</a> (fig.).","next":"BDB, מַרְעִית","prev":"BDB, רֹעִי"}